Early Warning Signals
Based on arrears propagation logic:

## Leading Signals
• DPD1 ↑ for 2 consecutive months → risk build-up expected next month
• Flow-through >15% → warning of new delinquency pressure

## Lagging Signals
• Bad Rate spikes with no prior DPD1 increase
• often operational or collections bottleneck rather than origination quality issue

## Seasonality Flags
• Dec–Jan uplift common (spend spike + payment fatigue)
• May–Jul uplift may signal macro pressure (inflation, winter cost spikes)
